stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> AWAITING_RADIOLOGY: case opened, unread scans
    [*] --> AWAITING_TRIAGE: case opened, no scans
    AWAITING_RADIOLOGY --> AWAITING_TRIAGE: radiologist submits read
    AWAITING_TRIAGE --> PENDING_REVIEW: coordinator sets priority + assigns clinician
    PENDING_REVIEW --> VALIDATED: clinician approves (message sent to patient)
    PENDING_REVIEW --> RETURNED: clinician asks for more info
    RETURNED --> PENDING_REVIEW: patient replies (same clinician)
    RETURNED --> AWAITING_RADIOLOGY: patient adds a new scan
    AWAITING_TRIAGE --> MERGED: older duplicate open case (any open stage) folded into newest
    VALIDATED --> [*]
    MERGED --> [*]
